WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:01.870
- [Narrator] Maps from all over the world

00:00:01.870 --> 00:00:04.130
can be found at the click of a button,

00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:06.530
but sometimes places that look blank

00:00:06.530 --> 00:00:07.660
are actually full of life.

00:00:07.660 --> 00:00:10.077
(soft music)

00:00:16.630 --> 00:00:17.973
This is Primož.

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:20.760
And this is Isaac.

00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:22.899
Primož and his company Spatial Collective

00:00:22.899 --> 00:00:25.238
work with community organizers like Isaac

00:00:25.238 --> 00:00:27.623
to map unmapped communities.

00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:34.190
- [Narrator] Unmapped
communities are literally

00:00:34.190 --> 00:00:36.090
not found on maps.

00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:37.780
Important things like roads, schools

00:00:37.780 --> 00:00:39.600
and hospitals are missing.

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:41.200
When communities are unmapped,

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:43.520
governments can easily overlook them.

00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:45.730
This means that they miss
out on vital resources

00:00:45.730 --> 00:00:47.330
that they should have access to.

00:01:01.853 --> 00:01:03.050
- [Narrator] The process
begins with members

00:01:03.050 --> 00:01:05.400
of the community gathering
information on foot.

00:01:11.930 --> 00:01:13.860
These data points are
then sent to the team

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:15.400
at Spatial Collective.

00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:18.130
They plot them and fill in the map.

00:01:18.130 --> 00:01:20.910
When citizens have information
about what they're missing,

00:01:20.910 --> 00:01:23.610
they have the power to
advocate for what they deserve.

00:02:05.587 --> 00:02:07.920
(soft tone)

